ster, sizes, paperwork, payment tracking, volunteer sign-ups, and shared team music. Access is controlled by the account owner, who grants TeamHub access to specific people and can invite others by email.\"\n        }), /*#__PURE__*/(0, _reactJsxRuntime.jsx)(_srcComponentsStaticPage.P, {\n          children: \"The account owner may also share a single reusable team join code. When someone joins with it, they are placed in a pending \\\"New Members\\\" list with group-chat-only access until the owner assigns them a role (Parent of an Athlete, Coach, Staff, or Athlete) and attaches them to the appropriate profile. The owner can change a member's role or remove them at any time.\"\n        }), /*#__PURE__*/(0, _reactJsxRuntime.jsx)(_srcComponentsStaticPage.P, {\n          children: \"If you enter or upload information about other individuals \\u2014 including photos or audio \\u2014 you are responsible for having the appropriate authority or consent to do so, and for using that information solely for legitimate team-management purposes. This data is visible only to household logins you have granted TeamHub access. If a person listed in your roster asks you to remove their information, you can delete it within the app.\"\n        })]\n      }), /*#__PURE__*/(0, _reactJsxRuntime.jsx)(_srcComponentsStaticPage.LegalSection, {\n        heading: \"4. Uploaded Files & Media\",\n        children: /*#__PURE__*/(0, _reactJsxRuntime.jsx)(_srcComponentsStaticPage.P, {\n          children: \"When you import a spreadsheet, we process the file only to extract the rows you choose to import and to create the corresponding records in your account. Photos and audio files you upload are stored solely to provide the feature you used them for (for example, showing an athlete\\u2019s profile photo or letting your team play shared music) and to sync them across your household and TeamHub. We do not use uploaded files or media for any other purpose, and we do not sell them.\"\n        })\n    